,"gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"ca4384ac5c9c1fa23a869e36074a15bab0fecd6e","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/ca4384ac5c9c1fa23a869e36074a15bab0fecd6e","created_at":"2026-03-10T15:18:56Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDhmYWYwZTU3MmFlZTNmYmEwZGMyM2FiYTAxYmIwOTk3YWRjZDFkNjE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-10T12:15:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-10T22:40:25Z"},"tree":{"sha":"bac0013c3234c7533c7feb2bcca68e27376d83fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/bac0013c3234c7533c7feb2bcca68e27376d83fb"},"message":"integration: split bundled EventuallyWithT per-client in ACL tests\n\nSplit bundled EventuallyWithT blocks into per-client blocks in\nTestACLPolicyPropagationOverTime and strengthen peer readiness checks\nin TestACLTagPropagation.\n\nTestACLPolicyPropagationOverTime bundled all clients into single\nEventuallyWithT blocks, meaning one client with broken MagicDNS\n(a known intermittent issue in the unstable Tailscale channel)\nwould consume all retry budget for every other client. Splitting\nper-client follows the pattern used by all other integration tests\nand gives each client its own independent retry window.\n\nAlso makes the warm-up non-asserting: it polls for data-plane\nreadiness without failing the test, since the policy phase\nassertions are what actually validate correctness.\n\nTestACLTagPropagation/add-tag-grants-access failed because Step 3\nonly checked hostname presence in the NetMap after a tag change,\nnot full peer readiness (Online, InMagicSock, Relay, DNSName).\nWhen granting access to a previously-invisible peer, the WireGuard\ntunnel needs time to establish. Also adds a reverse-direction\ncheck (target sees source) since TCP requires bidirectional tunnels.\n\nUpdates #3125","parents":[{"sha":"f60acea97f5f8e4e79b2d24e696fe1a66b23b427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f60acea97f5f8e4e79b2d24e696fe1a66b23b427","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f60acea97f5f8e4e79b2d24e696fe1a66b23b427"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":23449536758,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887wFuvqzwAAAAV1s4j2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/23449536758","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61","created_at":"2026-03-10T22:40:48Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"87d33cfcc177f569ac5bc0105c0746dc484b9a0c","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDg3ZDMzY2ZjYzE3N2Y1NjlhYzViYzAxMDVjMDc0NmRjNDg0YjlhMGM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/87d33cfcc177f569ac5bc0105c0746dc484b9a0c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/87d33cfcc177f569ac5bc0105c0746dc484b9a0c","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T08:09:08Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T08:09:08Z"},"tree":{"sha":"1d897cf0961e3caeb20fc95424d62b7255cb30d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/1d897cf0961e3caeb20fc95424d62b7255cb30d1"},"message":"state: fix policy change race in UpdateNodeFromMapRequest\n\nWhen UpdateNodeFromMapRequest and SetNodeTags race on persistNodeToDB,\nthe first caller to run updatePolicyManagerNodes detects the tag change\nand returns a PolicyChange. The second caller finds no change and falls\nback to NodeAdded.\n\nIf UpdateNodeFromMapRequest wins the race, it checked\npolicyChange.IsFull() which is always false for PolicyChange (only sets\nIncludePolicy and RequiresRuntimePeerComputation). This caused the\nPolicyChange to be dropped, so affected clients never received\nPeersRemoved and the stale peer remained in their NetMap indefinitely.\n\nFix: check !policyChange.IsEmpty() instead, which correctly detects\nany non-trivial policy change including PolicyChange().\n\nThis fixes the root cause of TestACLTagPropagation/multiple-tags-partial-\nremoval flaking at ~20% on CI.\n\nUpdates #3125","parents":[{"sha":"8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/8faf0e572aee3fba0dc23aba01bb0997adcd1d61"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"85b203610e5b64342fdb63a011c0ed3503ed770c","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDg1YjIwMzYxMGU1YjY0MzQyZmRiNjNhMDExYzBlZDM1MDNlZDc3MGM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/85b203610e5b64342fdb63a011c0ed3503ed770c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/85b203610e5b64342fdb63a011c0ed3503ed770c","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T08:09:25Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T08:09:25Z"},"tree":{"sha":"d37db61b76ef42cf9ab9406ede804383b71ce6fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/d37db61b76ef42cf9ab9406ede804383b71ce6fb"},"message":"integration: split per-client assertions and use IPs for positive curls\n\nSplit assertPingAll and assertPingDerpAll so each client gets its own\nEventuallyWithT block. Previously all clients shared one block, so one\nslow client (e.g. re-establishing direct connections after Up/Down\ncycles) consumed the entire retry budget for every other client. This\nfixes TestPingAllByIPManyUpDown and hardens all 18 call sites.\n\nSwitch positive curl checks in TestACLPolicyPropagationOverTime from\nFQDN to IPv4 addresses. The test validates ACL policy propagation, not\nDNS resolution. The unstable Tailscale channel has an intermittent\nMagicDNS bug where DNS resolution permanently fails for ~30% of\ncontainer instances. Using IPs removes this as a failure mode. Negative\nchecks remain FQDN-based since DNS failure equals expected curl failure.\n\nUpdates #3125","parents":[{"sha":"87d33cfcc177f569ac5bc0105c0746dc484b9a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/87d33cfcc177f569ac5bc0105c0746dc484b9a0c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/87d33cfcc177f569ac5bc0105c0746dc484b9a0c"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"2f8387572330dd26e1d3bbf583af732788545752","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDJmODM4NzU3MjMzMGRkMjZlMWQzYmJmNTgzYWY3MzI3ODg1NDU3NTI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2f8387572330dd26e1d3bbf583af732788545752","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2f8387572330dd26e1d3bbf583af732788545752","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T09:08:06Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T09:08:06Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0d208f6dadd2a95614c27537a3387b7a683bf751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/0d208f6dadd2a95614c27537a3387b7a683bf751"},"message":"integration: reduce ping count in assertPingAll for more retries\n\nWith the default ping count of 10 and timeout of 5s, each failed ping\nattempt with --until-direct=true blocks for ~50 seconds. Within the\n120s EventuallyWithT window, this gives only ~2 retries. WireGuard\ncontinues establishing direct connections in the background, but the\ntest has too few chances to catch the moment direct becomes available.\n\nReduce to count=3 (15s per failed attempt) so EventuallyWithT gets ~7\nretries instead of ~2. This does not change what the test validates —\ndirect connections are still required — it just distributes retry time\nmore effectively between the inner retry (tailscale ping) and the outer\nretry (EventuallyWithT).\n\nFixes TestPingAllByIPManyUpDown and TestEphemeralInAlternateTimezone\nflaking on CI with \"direct connection not established\".\n\nUpdates #3125","parents":[{"sha":"85b203610e5b64342fdb63a011c0ed3503ed770c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/85b203610e5b64342fdb63a011c0ed3503ed770c","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/85b203610e5b64342fdb63a011c0ed3503ed770c"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"b4f057f75ed97d072bb9e4347fa525e9fec5c1be","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGI0ZjA1N2Y3NWVkOTdkMDcyYmI5ZTQzNDdmYTUyNWU5ZmVjNWMxYmU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b4f057f75ed97d072bb9e4347fa525e9fec5c1be","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b4f057f75ed97d072bb9e4347fa525e9fec5c1be","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T10:35:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-03-11T10:35:20Z"},"tree":{"sha":"12a78b3ffc0ecda923af922d263b241283fc3f19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/12a78b3ffc0ecda923af922d263b241283fc3f19"},"message":"integration: remove overly strict online checks from Up/Down loop\n\nThe requireAllClientsOnline calls added inside the Up/Down loop require\nevery peer's accumulated MapResponses to show all nodes as online. After\n3 rapid Up/Down cycles with 12 nodes, this cross-validation between\nbatcher, mapresponses, and nodestore is too strict: mapresponse delivery\nfor 2 out of 12 nodes can take longer than 120s on CI runners.\n\nRemove the two online requireAllClientsOnline calls from the loop. The\nWaitForTailscaleSync already validates client-side peer readiness\n(InNetworkMap, InMagicSock) and assertPingAll validates actual direct\nconnectivity. The initial setup check and the offline check remain.\n\nUpdates #3125","parents":[{"sha":"2f8387572330dd26e1d3bbf583af732788545752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2f8387572330dd26e1d3bbf583af732788545752","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2f8387572330dd26e1d3bbf583af732788545752"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4066831696","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3126#issuecomment-4066831696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3126","id":4066831696,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz887yZu1Q","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T10:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T10:59:35Z","body":"Closing after https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3130, https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3143, https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3144, https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3134, https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3145, I think we are in a better place now, with less invasive changes and more internal improvements in headscale. \r\n\r\nWe should now work on various other things and collect new statistics for flaky tests from this point to figure out what we need to work on.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4066831696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":23603284778,"node_id":"CE_lADOEFLz887wFuvqzwAAAAV-3Ysq","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/23603284778","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.